     <p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2024\3\202403250807074560.Jpeg" style="width: 3.465972in; height: 2.313889in" alt="202403250807071259.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">22</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">午，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">北京大学博雅人才共育基地</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">授牌仪式在绍兴一中报告厅隆重举行。北京大学信息科学技术学院副院长、浙江省招生组组长陆俊林</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">北京大学现代农学院院长助理、浙江省招生组绍兴</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">地</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">区负责人曹学优</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴市教育局</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党委委员、副局长丁初效，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中党委书记、校长王琛及</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">其他</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班子成员，出席了授牌仪式。</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">信息学国际金牌教练陈合力</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、部分学生代表参加了仪式。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2024\3\202403250807071622.Jpeg" style="width: 3.358333in; height: 2.241667in" alt="202403250807073097.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仪式上，丁初效首先代表绍兴市教育局对北京大学表示衷心感谢，对绍兴一中表示热烈祝贺</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他用三个</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“播种”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">阐释</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">此次</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仪式</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">活动</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">重要意义</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。一是</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">播种更深的友谊</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，北京大学与绍兴、绍兴一中有着特殊的渊源，绍兴曾为北大输送过4位校长，其中有2位出自绍兴一中；二是</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">播种更好的合作</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，此次授牌</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">意味</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">着北京大学与绍兴一中之间将建立更好的合作平台</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，希望</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">两校</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">推进深度合作</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">携手共育英才</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；三是</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">播种更多的优质人才</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他期待绍兴一中的优秀学子们能借助</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">北京大学博雅人才共育基地</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的优势资源，脱颖而出，更好地成长成才。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2024\3\202403250807077709.Jpeg" style="width: 3.3625in; height: 2.245139in" alt="202403250807073544.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陆俊林代表北京大学详细介绍了“博雅人才共育基地”的目标定位、工作特色、机制举措、保障机制和前景展望。他</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">希望绍兴一中和北京大学</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">加强</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深度合作，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">强化优势互补，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">落实“双高共育”“双基共通”“双学共进”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等目标</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，实现基础教育与高等教育</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的无缝</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">衔接。</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陆俊林专题介绍了《北京大学的多元化人才培养机制》，重点分享了“强基计划”招生专业和有关培养方案。他强调，北京大学针对“博雅基地”提供资源倾斜，助推基地中学提升拔尖创新人才培育能力，以期为北京大学输送更多优秀人才。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2024\3\202403250807077096.Jpeg" style="width: 3.354167in; height: 2.238889in" alt="202403250807076566.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: Microsoft YaHei UI;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">据悉，在不断完善人才培养体系和深化本科教育综合改革的背景下，北京大学在全国范围内遴选优秀中学建立</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">博雅人才共育基地</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，旨在通过学科共建等方式实现两阶段人才培养的无缝对接，持续加强拔尖创新人才培养，为国家重大战略发展领域提供优秀的后备军。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: Microsoft YaHei UI;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">经过前期申报和审核、考评，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">继</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中信息学科、历史学科获评</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">北京大学首批博雅人才共育基地</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”后，绍兴一中</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">信息学科、物理学科再次获评“</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">北京大学博雅人才共育基地</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.75pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">向以上学科表示热烈的祝贺！</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2024\3\202403250807077455.Jpeg" style="width: 3.378472in; height: 2.225694in" alt="202403250807078807.Jpeg" /></strong></span></p>
    
